  "notes": "{復元|ふくげん} is used both for physical restoration and digital data recovery.\n\nFORMS:\n- {復|ふく} (return, restore) + {元|げん} (origin, original)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {修復|しゅうふく}: repair, restoration\n- {回復|かいふく}: recovery (health, situation)\n- {再建|さいけん}: rebuilding, reconstruction\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {復元|ふくげん}{工事|こうじ}: restoration work\n- {復元|ふくげん}ポイント: restore point (computing)\n- システムの{復元|ふくげん}: system restore",
